# Viewport UI verify

MCP `screen_capture` sees the 3D viewport only. Dock widgets and CoreGui do not appear.

- Verify Uiblox UI in Studio via Storyblox's `StarterGui.StorybloxViewport` harness (`storyblox-viewport*` attributes → `screen_capture` → error/stats). Never claim dock screenshot proof.
- Skill: `storyblox-viewport-test`.
